[1mHeader anatomy[0m
world name                   the world's name, always shown
disconnected                 the client lost its socket connection; it retries automatically, showing the last error
tick / game time             the current simulated tick and in-world clock time
running / PAUSED             the clock's state — PAUSED renders amber
speed (t/s)                  the requested speed step and its effective ticks/second
asked … in flight, debt …%   governed speed: the operator asked for more speed than the governor currently allows
[degraded]                   the clock's effective rate has fallen behind its target
[llm: provider kind]         the first LLM provider carrying an active health condition (see the guardian tab for the rest)
[suppressed: classes]        cognition classes currently being skipped at this speed (see the guardian tab for remedies)

[1mMap glyphs[0m
~    water — impassable to foot travel
♠    a tree — choppable for wood
"    wild forage — gatherable food
^    an intact rock outcrop — quarriable for stone
,    a depleted outcrop — passable, already quarried
ᴥ    a gru's den
▲    a lit fire — warmth, cooking
△    a cold fire, out of fuel
⌂    a built shelter
▣    a built oven
%    a ground stockpile of dropped goods
☐    a built chest, holding goods
▤▩   a built wall (▤ plank, ▩ stone); dim = damaged
·    a paved path (tan) — distinct from plain ground's dim ·
G    the gru — a predator; approach at your peril
✝    a villager's grave — marks where a death occurred
A/a  a villager's initial — uppercase awake, lowercase asleep (agents by initial (lowercase asleep, †dead))
†    a dead villager
     arrows pan, c center
     needs-critical & suppressed-mind mark agents, dying marks fire — needs-critical wins when both apply

[1mDock tabs[0m
2 chronicle  the event feed — narrated story or raw log; pauses into inspect mode when the clock is paused
3 guardian   the guardian's transcript and standing orders (fiction-layer content only)
4 villagers  the roster — select a villager for full detail, decisions, and inventory
5 systems    engine telemetry — LLM provider health, spend, and the cognition horizon (spec 053, never skinned)